"A half-grown copperback with a white blaze on its brow is bolder than the rest and follows strangers."
"The copperbacks hate the mire monitors and will mob a lone one that strays under their trees."
"Won over, the troop will warn Nala of the ashback and lead her to fruit and water."
"The copperbacks sleep in the Old Strangler's crown and the trees around it."
